---
// t = annual Sharpe x sqrt(years), assuming roughly independent daily returns.
// Grid computed in Python: t = SR * years**0.5, rounded to 2 decimals.
const years = [1, 2, 3, 5, 10];
const srs = [0.3, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0];
const t = (sr: number, y: number) => +(sr * Math.sqrt(y)).toFixed(2);
const cls = (v: number) => (v >= 3 ? 'is-hi' : v >= 1.96 ? 'is-mid' : '');
---
<figure class="apst">
  <div class="apst-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 360" role="img" aria-label="A table of t-statistics. Rows are years of data (1, 2, 3, 5, 10), columns are annual Sharpe ratios (0.3, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0). A Sharpe of 1.0 gives t of 1.00 after one year, 1.41 after two, 1.73 after three, 2.24 after five and 3.16 after ten. Cells at or above 1.96 are marked, and cells at or above 3 are marked again.">
    <text x="20" y="28" class="apst-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The same Sharpe ratio, a different verdict with more data</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng một Sharpe, kết luận khác đi khi có thêm dữ liệu</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="150" y="62" class="apst-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>t-statistic = annual Sharpe × √years</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>t-statistic = Sharpe năm × √số năm</tspan>
    </text>
    {srs.map((s, j) => (
      <text x={250 + j * 118} y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="apst-col">Sharpe {s.toFixed(1)}</text>
    ))}
    {years.map((y, i) => (
      <g>
        <text x="130" y={133 + i * 46} text-anchor="end" class="apst-col">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{y} {y === 1 ? 'year' : 'years'}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{y} năm</tspan>
        </text>
        {srs.map((s, j) => (
          <g>
            <rect x={196 + j * 118} y={105 + i * 46} width="108" height="38" rx="5" class={`apst-cell ${cls(t(s, y))}`} />
            <text x={250 + j * 118} y={130 + i * 46} text-anchor="middle" class="apst-val">{t(s, y).toFixed(2)}</text>
          </g>
        ))}
      </g>
    ))}
    <rect x="196" y="338" width="14" height="14" rx="3" class="apst-cell" />
    <text x="216" y="350" class="apst-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>under 1.96</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>dưới 1,96</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="316" y="338" width="14" height="14" rx="3" class="apst-cell is-mid" />
    <text x="336" y="350" class="apst-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1.96 to 3: passes the old bar only</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1,96 tới 3: chỉ qua ngưỡng cũ</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="596" y="338" width="14" height="14" rx="3" class="apst-cell is-hi" />
    <text x="616" y="350" class="apst-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>3 or more</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>từ 3 trở lên</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Say a strategy's daily returns are independent. A Sharpe of 1.0 is not enough after two years (t = 1.41), clears 1.96 after five (2.24) and clears 3 only after ten (3.16).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giả sử lợi suất ngày của một chiến lược độc lập với nhau. Sharpe 1,0 chưa đủ sau hai năm (t = 1,41), vượt 1,96 sau năm năm (2,24) và chỉ vượt 3 sau mười năm (3,16).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .apst { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .apst-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .apst svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .apst text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .apst .apst-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .apst .apst-sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .apst .apst-col { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .apst .apst-val { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .apst-cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .apst-cell.is-mid { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-opacity: 0.5; }
  .apst-cell.is-hi { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .apst figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
